OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will be dry across
OL,6,Fall parts will sunny spells. It will
OL,7,Fremain dry this afternoon with some
OL,8,Fbright or sunny spells. Warm, locally
OL,9,Fvery warm across Down.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fsome late sunshine. Then becoming
OL,13,Fcloudy overnight with some light and
OL,14,Fpatchy rain extending northeast for a
OL,15,Ftime. Freshening southwesterly in the
OL,16,Fnorthwest.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FSome hazy sunshine in the
OL,19,Fsoutheast at first otherwise rather
OL,20,Fcloudy with some rain at times in the
OL,21,Fnorth and west, drier elsewhere.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
